# React & routing

- Functional components only; default export the page/component
- Register new routes in `src/App.jsx` under the matching layout
- Auth routes stay outside `MainLayOut` when they need a standalone full-screen (e.g. `/login`)
- Admin pages live in `src/pages/Admin/` and get their own protected routes when auth is added
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes; use Sass in `src/helpers` only for shared mixins/helpers
- Use `appToast` from `src/helpers/toast.js` for feedback (`SuitsToaster` in `main.jsx`)

```jsx
// App.jsx route shape
{ path: '/login', element: <Login /> }
{ path: '', element: <MainLayOut />, children: [ /* nested pages */ ] }
```
